ted to go & She screamed in the cafe & She actually got the ticket, despite the long waitlist","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a6cd9aa9dc5a833d9a8b","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794483917192,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:45:17","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"9c701b3e159b4072a3070562a8ff532b"}